  <wpt lat="40.93061674545237" lon="21.786171048490132">
    <name>Kaimaktsalan</name>
    <cmt>viewpoint</cmt>
    <desc>A big tough climb that will end with a short hike. Incredible views if the weather is good but is notorious for bad weather. The descent follows the border with North Macedonia and there is no trail until riders get lower down. Pick your way down as best you can.</desc>
